WEBVTT

01:40.180 --> 01:44.800
=Love Story in the 1970s=

01:44.960 --> 01:47.940
=Episode 1=

01:47.980 --> 01:52.260
(Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory)
(April 1975)

01:52.980 --> 01:54.290
We're here!

01:54.404 --> 01:56.180
(Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory)
We're at the factory!

01:56.180 --> 01:57.500
(Controlled Quality, Consistent Supply,
Strong Management, High Productivity)

01:57.500 --> 01:58.420
(Learn from the Daqing Spirit)

01:58.420 --> 01:59.380
(Promote Revolutionary Traditions
of Diligence and Hard Work)

01:59.380 --> 02:00.380
(Learn from Comrade Lei Feng)

02:00.930 --> 02:03.570
(On this sunny day,)

02:03.648 --> 02:04.626
(we're holding)

02:04.626 --> 02:07.330
(a friendly basketball match between
No. 2 Electromechanical Factory)

02:07.330 --> 02:08.610
(and No. 1 Textile Factory!)

02:09.380 --> 02:12.730
(Their passion and spirit ablaze,)

02:12.730 --> 02:14.220
(and they are the epitome)

02:14.220 --> 02:17.982
(of unity, perseverance
and sportsmanship!)

02:19.570 --> 02:20.540
Morning, Mr. Qiu.

02:20.890 --> 02:21.610
Fei Ni.

02:22.026 --> 02:23.450
You look energetic with that flag.

02:27.100 --> 02:30.340
(Let's give them a round of applause)

02:30.340 --> 02:33.130
(Fei Ni)
(to cheer for them!)

02:33.130 --> 02:34.290
(High Spirits)

02:34.290 --> 02:43.660
- Go!
- Go!

02:43.660 --> 02:44.820
(Ms. Liu)
Ms. Liu.

02:45.170 --> 02:46.220
Why are you late?

02:46.220 --> 02:47.660
I went to get this.

02:47.660 --> 02:49.130
What a huge flag!

02:49.130 --> 02:50.060
How is it?

02:50.060 --> 02:52.100
Not good, we're one point behind!

02:52.100 --> 02:55.730
- Go!
- Go!

02:55.730 --> 02:56.410
Watch me.

02:57.220 --> 02:59.850
- Go!
- Go!

02:59.850 --> 03:02.030
Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory!

03:02.540 --> 03:04.400
(Ye Feng)
Never give up!

03:04.400 --> 03:06.410
- Never give up!
- Never give up!

03:06.410 --> 03:07.893
We will win!

03:07.893 --> 03:09.540
- We will win!
- We will win!

03:09.540 --> 03:11.660
(Xu Hongqi)
Good work organizing this event, Ms. Xu.

03:11.660 --> 03:13.170
Thank you, Sir.

03:13.170 --> 03:14.004
- Go!
- Go!

03:14.004 --> 03:15.871
(Combat Arrogance, Strive to Succeed)
Go! Go!

03:15.871 --> 03:16.980
- Go!
- Go!

03:16.980 --> 03:19.100
- Fight to win!
- Fight to win!

03:19.100 --> 03:25.220
- Go!
- Go!

03:25.220 --> 03:28.570
- Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory!
- Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory!

03:28.570 --> 03:32.130
- Never give up!
- Never give up!

03:32.130 --> 03:34.300
- Electromechanical Factory!
- Electromechanical Factory!

03:34.315 --> 03:37.380
- Win the battle!
- Win the battle!

03:37.380 --> 03:39.850
Every point counts!

03:39.850 --> 03:44.340
- Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory!
- Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory!

03:44.340 --> 03:46.820
Electromechanical Factory!

03:46.820 --> 03:48.290
Never give up!

03:48.290 --> 03:50.410
Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory!

03:50.410 --> 03:51.500
Win the battle!

03:51.500 --> 03:53.410
We will win!

03:53.410 --> 03:55.100
(Textile VS Electromechanical)
Win the battle!

03:55.100 --> 03:57.060
Dunk every shot!

03:57.060 --> 04:16.250
- Go!
- Go!

04:20.700 --> 04:23.900
(Jilin-Jiangcheng)

04:25.700 --> 04:26.720
Show your tickets.

04:31.660 --> 04:32.670
Ticket, please.

04:33.410 --> 04:34.410
Need water?

04:35.290 --> 04:36.410
Watch your bags.

04:38.930 --> 04:39.930
Ticket, please.

04:47.140 --> 04:47.930
Ticket, please.

04:52.610 --> 04:54.020
- Here.
- Excuse me.

04:55.750 --> 04:57.010
Look.

04:57.980 --> 04:59.740
Look, it's a mountain.
You love mountains.

05:00.370 --> 05:01.730
What's on the mountain?

05:02.730 --> 05:04.690
(Fang Muyang)
Trees, rocks and birds.

05:04.900 --> 05:06.050
You see birds?

05:06.050 --> 05:07.410
How many can you see?

05:07.410 --> 05:07.920
Five.

05:09.050 --> 05:10.540
You saw five birds?

05:11.050 --> 05:12.410
So many?

05:13.730 --> 05:15.020
There's a river.

05:15.100 --> 05:15.930
See?

05:16.370 --> 05:17.410
You like trains?

05:18.850 --> 05:19.930
Have some corn bread.

05:25.100 --> 05:25.490
Look.

05:27.340 --> 05:29.580
When we reach Jiangcheng,
I'll buy you something tasty.

05:30.050 --> 05:31.660
What's good in Jiangcheng?

05:31.780 --> 05:32.780
Jiangcheng?

05:33.610 --> 05:34.709
We've got lots of good food.

05:34.710 --> 05:36.729
Ice cream and pork chops
at Deda Western Restaurant,

05:36.730 --> 05:38.020
lion's head meatballs
at Yuhua Restaurant,

05:38.020 --> 05:39.020
beef noodles at Shangcheng Street,

05:39.020 --> 05:40.410
and brown sugar pastries
at the train station.

05:40.410 --> 05:41.960
Just thinking about it makes me drool.

05:41.960 --> 05:43.137
You're from Jiangcheng, too?

05:45.980 --> 05:46.780
Comrade.

05:47.660 --> 05:49.100
Why don't I sketch you two?

05:50.170 --> 05:52.220
For free.
Just give me a piece of corn bread.

05:54.610 --> 05:55.580
Are you an artist?

05:56.020 --> 05:56.810
Just a hobby.

05:57.250 --> 05:58.660
I've never had a portrait.

05:58.730 --> 06:00.071
Why don't we let him sketch us?

06:00.540 --> 06:01.170
Sure.

06:01.170 --> 06:02.850
Comrade, draw nicely.

06:02.850 --> 06:05.460
Otherwise, we won't give you any bread.

06:05.460 --> 06:06.050
Sure.

06:15.410 --> 06:20.100
- Go!
- Go!

06:20.100 --> 06:22.250
(Textile VS Electromechanical)
Go!

06:22.250 --> 06:29.020
- Go!
- Go!

06:39.671 --> 06:42.648
(Textile, 56 VS Electromechanical, 54)
Game over! Textile Factory wins!

06:59.340 --> 07:00.510
Great work.

07:01.540 --> 07:02.220
Congratulations.

07:02.220 --> 07:03.170
Thank you, Sir.

07:07.730 --> 07:09.170
Ms. Liu, hold this for me.

07:09.170 --> 07:09.850
Sure.

07:16.540 --> 07:17.660
Nice performance.

07:17.660 --> 07:18.580
Keep it up.

07:19.140 --> 07:20.340
Don't get arrogant, though.

07:20.490 --> 07:21.460
Relax, Mom.

07:21.930 --> 07:24.020
This year's city-level champion

07:24.020 --> 07:25.715
will be Jiangcheng
No. 1 Textile Factory.

07:26.140 --> 07:26.930
Don't call me mom.

07:27.340 --> 07:28.340
At the factory,

07:28.460 --> 07:29.610
call me Ms. Xu.

07:29.730 --> 07:30.700
Okay.

07:30.730 --> 07:31.540
Ms. Xu.

07:32.050 --> 07:32.930
Ye Feng.

07:33.410 --> 07:34.220
Wipe your sweat.

07:37.370 --> 07:39.660
You helped the Textile Factory
win the match.

07:39.660 --> 07:41.170
We ought to learn from you.

07:42.293 --> 07:43.700
I'm just doing what I should do.

07:46.610 --> 07:47.610
Comrades!

07:48.410 --> 07:49.290
Comrades!

07:51.540 --> 07:53.410
Excellent performance today!

07:53.980 --> 07:56.730
You have won an honor for our factory!

07:56.930 --> 07:57.610
Another thing.

07:57.610 --> 07:59.660
I've talked to the canteen,

07:59.660 --> 08:02.340
and they're serving braised meat today!

08:02.340 --> 08:03.700
- Great!
- Great!

08:03.700 --> 08:05.050
- Thank you, Ms. Xu!
- Thank you, Ms. Xu!

08:05.050 --> 08:06.050
Ms. Xu...

08:06.050 --> 08:07.980
We need you to take a look
at the promotional materials.

08:07.980 --> 08:08.310
Sure.

08:08.310 --> 08:08.850
This way.

08:08.850 --> 08:09.420
(Wang Xiaoman)

08:11.590 --> 08:13.600
Comrade, are you from
the Textile Factory, too?

08:16.540 --> 08:17.660
Have you finished using it?

08:23.290 --> 08:25.140
Yes, thank you.

08:37.420 --> 08:39.100
What can you see on the mountain?

08:39.530 --> 08:41.730
Grandma, I see boars.

08:42.340 --> 08:43.490
Birds and boars?

08:44.730 --> 08:45.610
Done.

08:45.850 --> 08:46.180
What...

08:46.530 --> 08:47.060
That fast?

08:47.650 --> 08:48.770
It'd better be good.

08:54.130 --> 08:54.940
Well?

08:55.130 --> 08:56.850
This looks better than me in real life.

08:57.300 --> 08:58.100
No way.

08:58.715 --> 09:00.130
You look better than the drawing.

09:04.610 --> 09:05.180
Comrade.

09:05.820 --> 09:06.370
Thanks.

09:09.580 --> 09:11.420
Kid, this is for you.

09:12.300 --> 09:13.130
It's okay.

09:13.137 --> 09:14.420
We're reaching our station soon.

09:14.420 --> 09:15.580
I'll buy something for him.

09:15.580 --> 09:16.820
Ma'am, just take it.

09:17.340 --> 09:18.300
Don't let him go hungry.

09:19.610 --> 09:20.820
Say thank you.

09:21.100 --> 09:22.490
Thank you.

09:22.850 --> 09:23.770
You're welcome.

09:23.770 --> 09:25.180
Thank you, young man.

09:25.180 --> 09:25.980
You're welcome.

09:28.250 --> 09:29.010
And this, too.

09:29.010 --> 09:29.460
Eat up.

09:29.980 --> 09:30.730
This is for you.

09:35.130 --> 09:36.650
How pretty.

09:36.650 --> 09:37.420
Right?

09:37.420 --> 09:37.820
Yeah.

09:38.060 --> 09:39.130
So realistic!

09:40.060 --> 09:42.460
He even drew the corn bread.

09:45.820 --> 09:47.010
You are an artist.

09:47.660 --> 09:49.420
Nah, I'm just dabbling.

09:50.100 --> 09:52.660
- It looks like me.
- Sketch me, too.

09:52.920 --> 09:53.370
Sure.

09:54.130 --> 09:54.820
Okay.

09:56.490 --> 09:58.610
Comrade, your hat is skewed.

09:58.610 --> 09:59.980
Yes, to the right.

10:11.140 --> 10:12.180
(Jiangcheng)

10:12.180 --> 10:13.610
Comrades, we're here.

10:13.610 --> 10:14.220
Come on.

10:14.220 --> 10:16.180
Please disembark orderly.

10:16.180 --> 10:19.250
Mind the gap.

10:19.250 --> 10:20.850
If you are carrying luggage,

10:20.850 --> 10:23.060
be sure to have it with you.

10:23.060 --> 10:24.480
If you are traveling with children,

10:24.480 --> 10:25.940
keep an eye on them

10:25.940 --> 10:27.100
and hold their hands.

10:27.490 --> 10:28.580
Disembark orderly.

10:28.580 --> 10:29.700
Safety first.

10:29.700 --> 10:30.580
(Fang Muyang.)

10:30.660 --> 10:32.580
(The factory was busy
during Chinese New Year.)

10:32.580 --> 10:33.850
(Everyone didn't go home.)

10:34.404 --> 10:35.693
(The busy period is just over.)

10:35.737 --> 10:37.893
(You're one of our best
role models in the mill.)

10:38.420 --> 10:39.890
(You have been chosen to represent)

10:39.910 --> 10:42.315
(everyone in the factory
to visit their families.)

10:45.100 --> 10:47.900
(Jiangcheng)

11:01.610 --> 11:02.370
Quick!

11:02.370 --> 11:04.010
Not so fast!

11:04.060 --> 11:04.770
Don't sneak off!

11:05.460 --> 11:06.700
Let's play there!

11:06.820 --> 11:07.650
- Okay!
- Okay!

11:10.226 --> 11:11.340
Why do you keep sneaking off?

11:12.140 --> 11:13.780
(10 Shengli Road)

11:15.340 --> 11:17.180
(10 Shengli Road, Jiangcheng
Sun Hongmei, Lin Xiuying's Mother)

11:18.890 --> 11:19.700
Hello.

11:20.580 --> 11:21.130
Hello.

11:21.580 --> 11:23.460
Are you Lin's mother?

11:23.980 --> 11:24.700
Yes.

11:25.370 --> 11:26.250
Hello, ma'am.

11:26.460 --> 11:27.580
I'm Lin's colleague.

11:27.626 --> 11:28.515
My name is Fang Muyang.

11:29.460 --> 11:30.850
You're Fang?

11:30.850 --> 11:32.860
Lin often writes to me
that you've been good to him

11:32.860 --> 11:34.060
while working in the northeast.

11:34.060 --> 11:35.610
It's my job.

11:35.610 --> 11:37.300
I'm on family reunion leave.

11:37.300 --> 11:39.610
Lin got these goods for you.

11:40.460 --> 11:41.650
He wanted me to tell you

11:41.650 --> 11:42.970
to enjoy them.

11:42.970 --> 11:44.160
Oh, my.

11:44.160 --> 11:46.620
You're on family leave,
and you're delivering for him?

11:46.620 --> 11:47.460
Have some water.

11:47.460 --> 11:48.430
Thank you, but no.

11:48.710 --> 11:50.060
I need to deliver more items.

11:50.060 --> 11:52.010
Okay, when you're done delivering,

11:52.010 --> 11:52.770
go home

11:52.770 --> 11:54.650
and visit your parents, okay?

11:58.300 --> 11:58.980
Okay.

11:59.130 --> 11:59.420
Okay.

12:00.300 --> 12:01.300
Okay, ma'am.

12:01.300 --> 12:02.250
I'm off.

12:02.980 --> 12:04.010
Bye, Fang.

12:04.010 --> 12:04.690
Goodbye.

12:06.650 --> 12:07.530
What a nice kid.

12:08.540 --> 12:13.300
(13 Xiangdong Road, Jiangcheng)

12:16.780 --> 12:26.740
(Jiangcheng No. 1
Textile Factory Office)

12:32.370 --> 12:34.570
Your thought report...

12:35.770 --> 12:37.690
It's well written.

12:37.770 --> 12:38.890
For the past year,

12:38.890 --> 12:41.580
I can see you've been working hard.

12:42.650 --> 12:43.300
Good job.

12:43.820 --> 12:45.490
Keep up the good work.

12:45.980 --> 12:46.940
Thank you, Ms. Xu.

12:47.180 --> 12:47.970
Tu.

12:48.290 --> 12:50.040
- Ms. Xu?
- We snapped lots of photos

12:50.040 --> 12:51.840
at the basketball court earlier.

12:51.840 --> 12:53.370
Tell the Publicity Division

12:53.604 --> 12:54.937
to print those photos

12:54.960 --> 12:56.370
and pin them on the Publicity Board.

12:56.370 --> 12:57.320
Okay, I'm on it.

12:57.320 --> 12:58.100
Go..

12:59.100 --> 13:01.610
Zhang, how's the report
for the Secretary coming along?

13:02.180 --> 13:03.250
I'm working on it, Ms. Xu.

13:03.940 --> 13:05.270
Keep it up.

13:05.580 --> 13:06.300
Yes, ma'am.

13:07.650 --> 13:08.300
Ms. Xu.

13:09.204 --> 13:10.320
What else do you need?

13:11.770 --> 13:13.550
This is my university
application letter.

13:16.010 --> 13:18.580
(Application Letter)
Last year, you said that I lack

13:18.580 --> 13:20.250
collective consciousness, and I agree.

13:20.730 --> 13:22.850
I've taken your advice to heart,

13:22.850 --> 13:24.180
and I've been improving myself.

13:24.370 --> 13:27.010
This year, I've joined every group event

13:27.010 --> 13:28.420
in the factory.

13:28.580 --> 13:29.340
So,

13:29.730 --> 13:30.700
can the factory

13:30.700 --> 13:32.300
vouch for me this year?

13:34.850 --> 13:35.940
Fei.

13:36.300 --> 13:38.460
Personally, I'd love to vouch

13:38.460 --> 13:40.940
for your application to
the Worker-Peasant-Soldier University.

13:41.180 --> 13:42.460
But, as you know,

13:42.460 --> 13:43.700
university referrals are decided

13:43.700 --> 13:45.890
by a poll among the factory leaders.

13:46.960 --> 13:48.100
So, right now,

13:48.100 --> 13:49.440
what you should do

13:50.130 --> 13:51.940
is to work hard

13:52.340 --> 13:53.370
and unite everyone.

13:53.740 --> 13:54.660
Got it, Ms. Xu.

13:55.010 --> 13:56.320
I will follow your orders.

13:56.320 --> 13:57.100
Ms. Xu.

13:57.110 --> 13:57.915
Today's paper.

13:58.871 --> 13:59.530
Perfect timing.

13:59.530 --> 14:01.620
(Feng Lin)
Feng, tell Fei Ni

14:01.890 --> 14:04.250
what a university candidate

14:04.250 --> 14:05.610
should keep in mind.

14:08.730 --> 14:10.420
Actually, Fei Ni is considered

14:10.420 --> 14:12.071
well-educated among the factory workers.

14:12.260 --> 14:14.990
However, education is not the key factor
in university applications.

14:15.004 --> 14:17.329
What candidates should do
is cut down on superficial work

14:17.330 --> 14:19.350
and align themselves
with the country's ideologies.

14:19.820 --> 14:20.730
Feng Lin.

14:20.850 --> 14:22.850
I've been doing that.

14:23.530 --> 14:25.340
I write thought reports every month.

14:25.340 --> 14:27.300
(Jiangcheng Daily)

14:28.940 --> 14:30.130
Let's see what you wrote.

14:31.300 --> 14:32.250
"Their eyes

14:32.250 --> 14:34.660
sparkle in a way that is unique
to the workers,

14:34.660 --> 14:36.090
full of clearity..."

14:36.090 --> 14:36.760
It's "clarity".

14:37.610 --> 14:38.700
Full of clarity.

14:38.740 --> 14:41.380
(Full of clarity)

14:47.460 --> 14:48.940
This is your biggest problem.

14:49.010 --> 14:50.700
Your writing should be easily understood

14:50.700 --> 14:52.220
by the ordinary workers and farmers.

14:52.220 --> 14:54.100
You just had to use
these difficult words

14:54.460 --> 14:57.060
to show that you're
more cultured than them, right?

14:57.180 --> 14:59.770
This proves that you look down on them.

14:59.770 --> 15:02.020
How is that being aligned
with the country's ideologies?

15:02.060 --> 15:04.150
No, Ms. Xu.

15:04.150 --> 15:05.340
I didn't.

15:11.610 --> 15:12.770
I think

15:13.270 --> 15:16.060
Feng has a point.

15:16.150 --> 15:18.260
Don't use difficult words.

15:18.260 --> 15:19.730
We need to cater

15:20.610 --> 15:21.650
to other comrades

15:21.890 --> 15:23.460
who are less educated.

15:25.100 --> 15:26.220
You're right, Ms. Xu.

15:26.370 --> 15:27.340
I'll keep that in mind.

15:27.890 --> 15:28.280
Good.

15:29.130 --> 15:30.100
But, Ms. Xu.

15:30.610 --> 15:31.730
If I can go to university

15:31.730 --> 15:33.180
and learn further,

15:33.180 --> 15:34.220
I'd certainly improve.

15:34.226 --> 15:36.130
What kind of place
do you think the university is?

15:36.130 --> 15:37.250
Everyone wants to improve.

15:37.250 --> 15:39.293
Does that mean everyone
gets to enter university?

15:39.804 --> 15:41.530
You got in
despite your vocabulary level,

15:41.530 --> 15:42.580
so why can't I?

15:42.580 --> 15:43.240
What do you mean?

15:43.240 --> 15:43.820
What I said.

15:43.820 --> 15:44.530
Say that again...

15:44.530 --> 15:45.340
That's enough.

15:47.420 --> 15:48.780
Your individualistic thoughts

15:49.426 --> 15:50.900
have not been fully eliminated.

15:51.450 --> 15:52.940
You react too strongly

15:53.780 --> 15:55.300
towards criticism.

15:57.180 --> 15:58.850
Ms. Xu, I think her criticism is wrong.

15:58.850 --> 16:01.660
Does that mean she can't criticize you?

16:03.090 --> 16:06.210
If she's right, work on it.
If not, keep it in mind.

16:28.540 --> 16:29.570
It's okay, Sir.

16:30.410 --> 16:31.210
Fang.

16:31.490 --> 16:32.900
Join us for dinner.

16:32.900 --> 16:33.970
Next time, Sir.

16:33.970 --> 16:34.450
Bye.

16:34.730 --> 16:35.260
See you.

16:35.430 --> 16:36.220
Stay safe.

16:41.700 --> 16:44.700
(44 Kangnan Road, Jiangcheng)

17:01.380 --> 17:05.300
(Humility Leads to Progress,
Pride Leads to Downfall)

17:15.620 --> 17:16.210
Fei Ni.

17:16.210 --> 17:16.730
You're back.

17:16.730 --> 17:17.200
Yeah.

17:17.290 --> 17:17.940
Hi, Ms. Wang.

17:19.580 --> 17:20.730
Come on, make a move.

17:20.730 --> 17:23.030
Playing chess with you can be so vexing.

17:24.100 --> 17:24.820
Mr. Liu.

17:25.690 --> 17:26.770
(Mr. Liu)
Ni, you're back.

17:27.970 --> 17:28.490
Dad.

17:28.490 --> 17:29.180
(Fei Mingde)

17:29.880 --> 17:31.600
The canteen was serving
braised meat today,

17:31.604 --> 17:32.471
so I got some for you.

17:33.380 --> 17:34.860
My daughter cares about me.

17:35.420 --> 17:36.660
Join me for a drink tonight.

17:37.180 --> 17:37.900
No, thanks.

17:37.900 --> 17:38.660
I'm going back.

17:39.290 --> 17:40.100
Bye.

17:41.860 --> 17:42.480
Come on.

17:42.730 --> 17:43.420
Hurry up.

17:44.782 --> 17:45.715
Make a move, will you?

17:45.715 --> 17:47.310
You didn't ask me to join your drinking.

17:47.315 --> 17:49.450
Who cares, you're losing anyway.

17:54.940 --> 17:55.970
Ni, you're back.

17:57.530 --> 17:59.340
Ni, I'm borrowing your vinegar.

18:00.520 --> 18:01.020
Mom.

18:01.490 --> 18:02.070
I'm home.

18:02.582 --> 18:03.650
There's rice in the pot.

18:03.650 --> 18:04.710
Help yourself.

18:04.890 --> 18:05.660
I'm not hungry.

18:05.660 --> 18:06.700
I'm skipping dinner.

18:06.940 --> 18:11.340
(Wu Baoying)

18:18.960 --> 18:19.880
You scared me.

18:19.880 --> 18:21.520
You didn't even make a sound.

18:22.500 --> 18:25.180
Ni seems to be down and preoccupied.

18:27.260 --> 18:29.850
She's submitting
her university application today.

18:31.090 --> 18:32.940
I guess she got rejected again.

18:34.810 --> 18:36.020
It's been four years.

18:36.020 --> 18:37.370
Does she still stand a chance?

18:37.940 --> 18:39.020
Dad, Mom.

18:40.560 --> 18:41.750
It's a small house.

18:42.180 --> 18:43.130
I can hear you.

18:47.340 --> 18:54.940
(15 April 1975)

18:55.020 --> 18:56.471
(44 Kangnan Road)
It's broken again?

18:56.500 --> 18:58.220
Yeah, the electric meter keeps ticking.

18:58.220 --> 18:58.900
Look.

19:07.940 --> 19:08.740
Stop!

19:11.700 --> 19:12.880
Nana, Jiang Xia!

19:12.880 --> 19:13.660
Get back here!

19:13.870 --> 19:14.700
Don't run off!

19:15.170 --> 19:15.850
Get back here!

19:17.530 --> 19:18.180
Yang.

19:18.740 --> 19:19.570
School's over?

19:20.090 --> 19:21.130
Wash your hands.

19:21.420 --> 19:23.260
(Tang Shutong)
I bought you ice cream.

19:23.850 --> 19:25.130
Thank you, Grandma.

19:25.130 --> 19:26.780
(Young Fang Muyang)

19:55.940 --> 19:56.560
Fang Muyang.

19:56.740 --> 19:58.700
Your parents have been sent
for re-education.

19:58.700 --> 20:00.290
You can't stay here anymore.

20:06.620 --> 20:09.020
(Young Fang Muyang)

20:28.570 --> 20:30.020
Comrade, who are you looking for?

20:32.610 --> 20:33.940
Wang Xiuju.

20:33.940 --> 20:34.980
Go in and turn right.

20:37.700 --> 20:38.330
Thank you.

20:52.180 --> 20:54.500
(University Plan: What I Need to Do)

20:54.700 --> 20:55.610
(Mr. Wang.)

20:55.610 --> 20:56.740
(Next week)

20:56.740 --> 20:58.330
(marks my third year working here.)

20:58.330 --> 21:00.570
That means I'm eligible
for a university referral.

21:00.570 --> 21:01.330
(Three Years Ago)

21:01.330 --> 21:02.850
I don't care if you're one week

21:02.850 --> 21:04.610
or one day short.

21:04.610 --> 21:06.520
Young lady, you have
many future opportunities.

21:06.700 --> 21:08.050
Don't rush.

21:09.770 --> 21:10.570
Mr. Wang.

21:10.570 --> 21:11.700
(Two Years Ago)

21:11.700 --> 21:13.460
Have you looked at my application form?

21:13.460 --> 21:14.460
I've been working here

21:14.460 --> 21:16.290
for three years and 351 days.

21:16.290 --> 21:17.770
Work length is not a criterion.

21:18.570 --> 21:19.920
It's all about work capability.

21:20.026 --> 21:22.071
We'll talk when you win
a Technician Award.

21:24.380 --> 21:25.290
(Technician Award Winners)

21:25.290 --> 21:27.404
(Fei Ni)
Ms. Xu, Mr. Wang mentioned

21:27.448 --> 21:29.500
(One Year Ago)
that if I win a Technician Award,

21:29.500 --> 21:31.130
I'd get a university referral.

21:32.220 --> 21:33.130
As far as I know,

21:33.810 --> 21:36.530
you haven't been joining
group events this year.

21:36.530 --> 21:37.530
Fei Ni.

21:38.050 --> 21:39.980
Be a team player.

21:39.980 --> 21:41.940
University referrals are decided

21:41.940 --> 21:44.500
based on a voting process.

21:45.420 --> 21:46.050
(You seem to)

21:46.050 --> 21:47.130
(react too strongly)

21:48.090 --> 21:49.530
(against criticism.)

21:50.290 --> 21:51.610
(If she's right, work on it.)

21:51.610 --> 21:52.715
(If not, keep it in mind.)

22:05.020 --> 22:12.500
(Jiangcheng No. 2 Guesthouse)

22:12.500 --> 22:13.130
Comrade.

22:13.570 --> 22:14.960
How much for a night's stay?

22:15.071 --> 22:16.420
Do you have a referral letter?

22:17.130 --> 22:17.700
Yes.

22:23.900 --> 22:24.640
(This is to certify that Fang Muyang)

22:24.640 --> 22:25.340
(is visiting Jiangcheng
for family visitations.)

22:25.340 --> 22:25.940
(He should be granted staying rights.)

22:26.060 --> 22:27.799
It's 0.70 yuan
for a single room per night.

22:27.800 --> 22:29.160
How many nights are you staying?

22:29.940 --> 22:30.740
0.70 yuan?

22:34.500 --> 22:36.110
Zhang, we're off.

22:36.426 --> 22:37.900
There's no one else inside, right?

22:37.900 --> 22:38.640
No.

22:38.980 --> 22:40.050
Good.

22:41.300 --> 22:44.130
(Dongfeng Bathhouse)

22:44.130 --> 22:45.130
Come early tomorrow.

22:47.620 --> 22:56.100
(Warm Water)

23:57.770 --> 23:58.660
(Two yuan.)

23:58.660 --> 24:00.330
I'll buy it back in the future
at twice the amount.

24:00.330 --> 24:01.130
(Six Years Ago)

24:01.130 --> 24:03.090
(Young Fei Ni)
I can only pay one yuan.

24:03.370 --> 24:04.180
No deal, then.

24:04.420 --> 24:05.760
It's useless to you, anyway.

24:05.760 --> 24:07.190
You won't be using it.

24:07.382 --> 24:08.737
I'll sell it to the junk collector.

24:08.980 --> 24:10.700
Sure, go ahead.

24:10.980 --> 24:12.370
I'm sure no one else

24:12.370 --> 24:14.740
other than me would want that.

24:18.660 --> 24:19.740
No one wants it?

24:19.850 --> 24:20.770
I'll burn it, then.

24:21.040 --> 24:21.850
No.

24:24.260 --> 24:25.330
1.50 yuan.

24:26.130 --> 24:27.420
I can't go higher.

24:27.420 --> 24:29.530
I still need to buy lunch.

24:30.500 --> 24:31.260
Deal.

24:34.460 --> 24:36.570
Anyway, I'm just leaving it
with you temporarily.

24:37.180 --> 24:38.700
I'll buy it back when I return.

24:40.660 --> 24:41.460
Fei Ni.

24:43.660 --> 24:44.610
I'm leaving tomorrow.

24:50.671 --> 24:53.248
Actually, it's good
that you're going away to work.

24:53.530 --> 24:56.020
You can go to many places
and see different scenery.

24:56.980 --> 24:59.460
Unlike me, who's never left Jiangcheng.

25:00.660 --> 25:01.460
It's okay.

25:01.604 --> 25:04.320
Wherever I go, I'll draw everything I see
so I can show you.

25:04.330 --> 25:05.500
No.

25:05.500 --> 25:07.530
You hid one of your sketches
in my Maths workbook,

25:07.530 --> 25:08.810
and I got a scolding.

25:08.980 --> 25:10.370
I don't want your sketches.

25:16.850 --> 25:18.660
How long has it been since you last ate?

25:18.850 --> 25:19.980
Not that long ago.

25:20.500 --> 25:21.500
Two or three days.

25:24.610 --> 25:25.330
Here.

25:25.330 --> 25:25.980
No.

25:25.980 --> 25:26.940
We made a deal,

25:26.940 --> 25:27.700
so 1.50 yuan it is.

25:29.020 --> 25:30.610
It's a loan. Remember to pay me back.

25:31.130 --> 25:31.940
Forget it.

25:32.137 --> 25:33.293
I guess you won't be able

25:33.293 --> 25:35.050
to repay the money you owe me.

25:35.093 --> 25:36.330
Just take care of yourself.

25:39.500 --> 25:39.940
Fei Ni.

25:43.700 --> 25:44.660
Wait for me.

25:46.980 --> 25:48.660
I'll pay twice as much back.

25:49.530 --> 25:51.130
Sure, it's a promise.

27:04.370 --> 27:05.500
Young lad.

27:07.610 --> 27:09.180
You really think

27:09.180 --> 27:10.570
you can hide yourself like this?

27:15.980 --> 27:16.770
Sir.

27:17.500 --> 27:18.770
There's no one else here.

27:18.770 --> 27:20.180
Can you let me stay the night here?

27:21.090 --> 27:22.180
I'll leave in the morning.

27:22.180 --> 27:23.700
I can't.

27:24.460 --> 27:26.700
Who knows whether you're good or bad?

27:27.260 --> 27:29.050
Go, run along now.

27:29.050 --> 27:30.700
It's more comfortable to sleep at home.

27:33.220 --> 27:34.020
I don't have a home.

27:34.500 --> 27:35.290
What...

27:37.090 --> 27:39.290
Still, you can't sleep here.

27:39.980 --> 27:41.260
This is a public space.

27:41.260 --> 27:42.940
If the higher-ups find out,

27:43.660 --> 27:44.940
I'd get punished.

27:45.330 --> 27:47.020
Fine, I'll leave.

27:49.610 --> 27:51.290
If you really have nowhere else to go,

27:51.570 --> 27:54.570
you can share a room with me tonight.

27:54.810 --> 27:57.220
I don't think your room
can fit another person.

27:58.420 --> 27:59.850
Beggars can be choosy, huh?

28:03.404 --> 28:04.530
I don't want to trouble you.

28:04.980 --> 28:05.980
The world is huge.

28:05.980 --> 28:07.420
I'll find a place to sleep.

28:08.020 --> 28:09.500
(Dongfeng Bathhouse)

28:09.500 --> 28:10.740
What a tall fellow.

28:11.137 --> 28:12.700
It's true, there's no room for him.

28:35.180 --> 28:36.610
(Fei Ni's house should be here.)

28:39.900 --> 28:40.980
(Which house is it?)

29:31.740 --> 29:34.660
Help! Building collapse!

29:35.220 --> 29:37.850
Ms. Liu's house has collapsed! Help!

29:38.570 --> 29:40.610
Help! Building collapse!

29:40.810 --> 29:42.850
Someone, help!

29:43.130 --> 29:44.700
Ms. Liu!

29:45.290 --> 29:46.500
Are you okay, Ms. Liu?

29:46.500 --> 29:48.610
Quick, go save Ms. Liu!

29:48.770 --> 29:49.900
Where's my raincoat?

29:50.330 --> 29:51.900
Get me a flashlight.

29:51.900 --> 29:52.530
Okay.

29:52.850 --> 29:54.090
Dad, Mom, what happened?

29:54.090 --> 29:56.090
I heard someone cry for help.

29:56.090 --> 29:57.180
I'm going out.

29:57.180 --> 29:58.260
Stay at home, ladies.

29:58.260 --> 30:00.090
Be careful out there.

30:03.290 --> 30:03.740
Ms. Liu!

30:04.050 --> 30:04.810
What happened?

30:04.900 --> 30:05.740
My house collapsed!

30:05.900 --> 30:07.530
My husband and son are inside!

30:07.530 --> 30:08.330
Quick!

30:08.330 --> 30:09.290
Got them!

30:09.290 --> 30:10.980
- Get the cart!
- Maodou!

30:11.130 --> 30:11.810
Quick!

30:12.050 --> 30:13.230
Get the cart!

30:13.610 --> 30:14.130
Quick!

30:14.130 --> 30:14.940
Put him down!

30:15.330 --> 30:16.130
Help me!

30:16.130 --> 30:16.660
Careful!

30:16.980 --> 30:17.740
Hold tight.

30:18.330 --> 30:19.420
Maodou!

30:20.460 --> 30:22.930
- Hold tight!
- Hold tight!

30:22.960 --> 30:23.520
Go!

30:23.520 --> 30:24.220
Be careful!

30:24.220 --> 30:25.330
Hurry up!

30:28.404 --> 30:29.850
All the houses here are in danger.

30:29.980 --> 30:31.260
A second collapse might happen.

30:31.500 --> 30:32.370
Get everyone out!

30:32.370 --> 30:33.050
Okay.

30:33.130 --> 30:34.530
- Quick!
- Quick!

30:35.050 --> 30:36.330
Get everyone out!

30:37.130 --> 30:37.940
Ms. Zhao!

30:38.090 --> 30:39.050
Come down!

30:39.050 --> 30:40.420
Your house is collapsing!

30:41.180 --> 30:41.940
Ms. Liu!

30:42.770 --> 30:43.950
Ms. Liu, get out!

30:43.950 --> 30:45.360
- Ms. Liu!
- Wake up!

30:45.740 --> 30:46.050
Quick!

30:46.050 --> 30:46.530
Run!

30:46.530 --> 30:47.160
Quick!

30:47.520 --> 30:47.910
Go!

31:09.700 --> 31:10.370
Go!

31:15.570 --> 31:16.700
Someone help!

31:17.180 --> 31:18.460
Another house has collapsed!

31:19.130 --> 31:19.750
Feng Lin!

31:19.980 --> 31:20.910
Feng Lin!

31:21.500 --> 31:22.850
- Feng Lin!
- Hey!

31:22.850 --> 31:24.130
- Help!
- What's going on?

31:24.130 --> 31:26.320
This tree caused
Feng Lin's house to collapse.

31:26.320 --> 31:27.640
She is still inside!

31:27.640 --> 31:28.240
I'll help!

31:29.050 --> 31:30.220
- Feng Lin!
- Feng Lin!

31:30.460 --> 31:31.770
- Feng Lin!
- Feng Lin!

31:32.180 --> 31:32.850
Feng Lin!

31:33.030 --> 31:33.590
Feng Lin!

31:33.610 --> 31:34.330
Feng Lin!

31:34.960 --> 31:35.740
Feng Lin!

31:37.130 --> 31:38.050
Feng Lin!

31:39.420 --> 31:40.260
What should we do?

31:45.130 --> 31:45.700
Comrade!

31:46.130 --> 31:46.570
Comrade!

31:47.740 --> 31:48.290
(Wang Defa)

31:48.290 --> 31:48.940
What happened?

31:50.640 --> 31:51.560
I'll do it!

32:11.337 --> 32:12.020
I can't do it.

32:12.020 --> 32:14.020
Get more people to help.

32:18.700 --> 32:19.420
Go!

32:19.900 --> 32:20.370
Go!

32:21.050 --> 32:21.530
Comrade.

32:21.850 --> 32:22.260
Save me.

32:22.740 --> 32:23.220
Comrade.

32:29.290 --> 32:29.980
Comrade.

32:29.980 --> 32:31.810
Save me. I don't want to die.

32:31.810 --> 32:32.980
Comrade.

32:33.330 --> 32:35.260
Comrade, save me. I don't want to die.

32:35.260 --> 32:35.900
Comrade.

32:35.900 --> 32:37.220
I don't want to die.

32:37.370 --> 32:38.020
You won't.

32:38.130 --> 32:39.180
Your leg is stuck.

32:44.900 --> 32:45.260
Comrade.

32:45.271 --> 32:46.048
Here's a raincoat.

32:46.940 --> 32:47.330
Comrade.

32:48.420 --> 32:49.130
What is it?

32:53.330 --> 32:53.850
Nothing.

32:54.180 --> 32:54.700
Thank you.

32:55.290 --> 32:55.900
You're welcome.

32:57.582 --> 32:58.500
I'll count to three.

32:58.560 --> 33:00.050
Pull your leg out as hard as you can.

33:00.420 --> 33:01.220
You hear me?

33:01.850 --> 33:02.330
One!

33:02.420 --> 33:03.020
Two!

33:03.020 --> 33:03.500
Three!

33:07.980 --> 33:08.460
One!

33:08.460 --> 33:09.020
Two!

33:09.020 --> 33:09.760
Three!

33:22.900 --> 33:24.420
Go!

33:31.500 --> 33:32.160
Go!

33:38.640 --> 33:39.270
Quick!

33:39.330 --> 33:41.430
Another house has collapsed! Go!

33:41.700 --> 33:42.220
Run!

33:42.220 --> 33:43.330
Check if anyone's hurt!

33:43.530 --> 33:44.530
Where is he?

33:44.530 --> 33:45.210
Over there!

33:45.220 --> 33:46.050
He's still inside.

33:46.050 --> 33:47.330
Go now!

33:47.530 --> 33:47.900
Go!

33:48.420 --> 33:48.850
Go!

33:49.980 --> 33:50.500
Quick!

33:50.500 --> 33:51.937
Check if there's anyone else inside!

33:52.693 --> 33:53.500
That's a big tree.

33:53.500 --> 33:55.048
Everyone should've evacuated by now.

33:56.760 --> 33:58.093
There's still someone inside!

33:58.330 --> 33:59.000
Save him!

33:59.090 --> 33:59.600
Quick!

33:59.600 --> 34:00.530
- Save him!
- Save him!

34:00.530 --> 34:01.170
Save him!

34:01.740 --> 34:02.190
Go!

34:02.330 --> 34:03.360
Comrade!

34:03.520 --> 34:04.010
Comrade!

34:20.380 --> 34:21.982
Last night's rain was hellish.

34:21.990 --> 34:23.900
- Homes were destroyed.
- Here, some warm water.

34:23.900 --> 34:24.420
Yes.

34:31.610 --> 34:32.410
Pull this out.

34:32.730 --> 34:33.250
Okay.

34:33.730 --> 34:34.250
Slowly.

34:34.500 --> 34:35.380
Be careful.

34:40.100 --> 34:42.380
(Jiangcheng Daily)

34:45.980 --> 34:46.730
Eat up.

34:46.730 --> 34:48.060
You can read later.

34:48.730 --> 34:50.570
I'm searching for news

34:50.570 --> 34:51.860
about the young man last night.

34:52.610 --> 34:53.770
News doesn't appear that fast.

34:54.610 --> 34:55.860
You don't know this,

34:55.860 --> 34:57.540
but that young man was godsent.

34:57.980 --> 35:00.610
When he saved Liu's family,

35:00.610 --> 35:02.060
he was already a hero.

35:02.250 --> 35:05.540
Then, he went back there

35:05.540 --> 35:07.170
to save more lives.

35:07.170 --> 35:08.570
What a pity.

35:09.250 --> 35:10.690
I thought he's in hospital?

35:10.690 --> 35:11.610
He didn't make it?

35:12.380 --> 35:13.650
How would I know?

35:14.130 --> 35:15.020
I heard

35:15.020 --> 35:17.610
his condition was serious, though.

35:19.690 --> 35:20.540
That young man

35:20.540 --> 35:21.860
was brave

35:21.860 --> 35:23.020
and dashing.

35:23.020 --> 35:24.860
(A Female Worker's Hymn of Love)

35:25.060 --> 35:25.540
Dad.

35:26.570 --> 35:28.170
Can you give me the paper?

35:28.460 --> 35:29.650
Not now.

35:30.940 --> 35:31.770
Give her that.

35:32.860 --> 35:33.980
Ni wants to go to university.

35:33.980 --> 35:34.610
We subscribed to the daily

35:34.610 --> 35:36.760
so that she can keep herself
updated with current issues

35:36.760 --> 35:38.693
as well as the country's
policies and ideologies.

35:38.782 --> 35:40.610
It's not to satisfy
your hunger for gossip.

35:40.610 --> 35:42.020
You can read about that elsewhere.

35:42.020 --> 35:45.690
(A Female Worker's Hymn of Love.)

35:45.880 --> 35:48.582
(For 20 years, a female worker
has been nursing a wounded hero.)

35:48.990 --> 35:53.020
(Now married, her dedication has also
won her a place in university.)

35:53.820 --> 35:54.940
The Secretary and I

35:54.940 --> 35:56.420
went to the hospital this morning.

35:57.170 --> 35:58.500
That young man

35:58.860 --> 36:00.540
is currently in stable condition.

36:01.210 --> 36:03.340
However, he did bump his head,

36:03.360 --> 36:05.210
so there may be
a blood clot inside his brain.

36:05.380 --> 36:06.820
No one knows

36:07.690 --> 36:08.460
when he'll wake up.

36:09.210 --> 36:10.860
All his family members

36:11.250 --> 36:12.570
have been sent for re-education.

36:13.170 --> 36:14.650
We can't reach them for now.

36:15.540 --> 36:16.650
I called you two over

36:16.650 --> 36:17.940
to discuss

36:18.420 --> 36:19.730
who we should send

36:20.540 --> 36:22.340
to take care of him.

36:24.060 --> 36:24.650
Ms. Xu.

36:25.020 --> 36:27.420
I know he saved my family,

36:27.420 --> 36:28.610
and I should go,

36:29.210 --> 36:31.940
but you know my family's condition.

36:31.940 --> 36:34.540
I have old folks and a kid to care for.

36:34.860 --> 36:37.340
I can take care of him for a day or two,

36:37.860 --> 36:40.940
but as for the long term...

36:42.420 --> 36:45.130
As you can see, my arm is injured.

36:49.460 --> 36:50.250
Feng Lin?

36:56.460 --> 36:57.500
I...

37:01.460 --> 37:01.820
I...

37:01.820 --> 37:02.380
Ms. Xu!

37:04.730 --> 37:05.540
I'll go!

37:06.420 --> 37:07.290
Fei Ni?

37:07.940 --> 37:08.570
Ms. Xu.

37:09.610 --> 37:12.250
I will take care of the hero
on behalf of our factory

37:12.250 --> 37:13.650
until he fully recovers.

37:13.650 --> 37:14.650
Trust me.

37:18.380 --> 37:19.460
Great!

37:20.060 --> 37:23.060
This is the perfect proletariat spirit!

37:26.610 --> 37:27.540
Fei.

37:28.130 --> 37:29.090
Do a good job.

37:29.380 --> 37:30.900
When the hero recovers,

37:31.290 --> 37:33.690
you will become our role model.

37:34.671 --> 37:36.190
I will make everyone in the factory,

37:36.220 --> 37:38.060
no, everyone in the industry,

37:38.210 --> 37:39.340
learn from you!

37:39.537 --> 37:40.900
You can count on me, Ms. Xu!

37:42.340 --> 37:43.060
Good.

37:50.420 --> 37:54.060
(Jiangcheng Worker-Peasant Hospital)

37:54.060 --> 37:55.420
(Keep Quiet)

38:01.770 --> 38:02.880
I'll write an article

38:02.880 --> 38:04.410
about the hero later.

38:30.500 --> 38:31.570
Which daily are you from?

38:32.540 --> 38:34.280
The patient needs to rest.

38:34.540 --> 38:36.460
You're affecting our work.

38:36.900 --> 38:38.170
I'm not a reporter.

38:38.540 --> 38:41.170
I was sent by the Textile Factory
to tend to the hero.

38:43.315 --> 38:45.426
At least your factory's
still got some conscience.

38:45.730 --> 38:46.860
It's good that you're here.

38:47.090 --> 38:48.340
It's been rowdy in here.

38:48.340 --> 38:49.848
Reporters have been coming in and out.

38:49.871 --> 38:50.690
How annoying.

38:50.900 --> 38:51.730
Miss.

38:52.090 --> 38:53.570
When will he wake up?

38:53.860 --> 38:55.500
I can't say for sure.

38:55.610 --> 38:56.650
What's his name?

38:56.900 --> 38:57.860
Fang Muyang.

38:59.730 --> 39:00.460
Fang Muyang?

39:07.671 --> 39:09.250
(Six Years Ago)
Sell it to me for 0.03 yuan.

39:09.250 --> 39:10.900
It wasn't easy catching this housefly.

39:10.900 --> 39:11.610
0.05 yuan.

39:11.610 --> 39:13.340
That's crazy. 0.03 yuan. Hand it over.

39:13.340 --> 39:14.290
0.05 yuan.

39:14.290 --> 39:15.604
0.04 yuan, tops. Hand it over.

39:15.671 --> 39:16.830
0.05 yuan, and I mean it.

39:18.860 --> 39:20.090
Fine, 0.05 yuan.

39:20.230 --> 39:20.940
Deal.

39:28.500 --> 39:29.610
Fang Muyang, are you nuts?

39:29.610 --> 39:30.880
Why are you stealing from her?

39:31.130 --> 39:32.130
I'm buying from her.

39:34.540 --> 39:36.420
Fei Ni, say goodbye to my money.

39:38.210 --> 39:39.820
Who are you?

39:39.820 --> 39:41.900
Kids, let me introduce someone new.

39:42.090 --> 39:42.940
He's joining us

39:42.940 --> 39:44.420
as a repeating student.

39:44.420 --> 39:45.610
His name is Fang Muyang.

39:45.610 --> 39:46.570
Starting from today,

39:46.570 --> 39:48.460
he's part of our class.

39:48.460 --> 39:50.060
Let's welcome him.

39:51.980 --> 39:52.650
Fang Muyang.

39:53.010 --> 39:54.380
(Chen Wenshu)
Sit beside Fei Ni.

39:57.730 --> 39:59.770
Let's begin today's class.

39:59.860 --> 40:01.170
Yesterday, we read the first part

40:01.170 --> 40:02.650
of Musings on the Red Cliff.

40:02.650 --> 40:03.982
We're actually sitting together.

40:04.980 --> 40:06.000
Okay, everyone.

40:06.540 --> 40:09.150
Open your textbooks. Let's continue.

40:23.990 --> 40:25.560
Fei Ni fell on the floor!

40:28.460 --> 40:29.420
Quiet!

40:29.650 --> 40:31.130
What are you doing, Fei Ni?

40:31.460 --> 40:32.860
Yelling in my class?

40:32.860 --> 40:34.130
You have no discipline.

40:34.130 --> 40:35.290
Meet me in my office later.

40:36.130 --> 40:37.130
Yes, ma'am.

40:47.210 --> 40:47.980
Fei Ni.

40:48.071 --> 40:49.500
You finished your reflection report?

40:49.690 --> 40:50.730
Did Ms. Chen lecture you?

40:51.770 --> 40:52.210
Let's go.

40:52.900 --> 40:53.900
I'll take you home.

40:54.290 --> 40:55.170
No need.

40:57.420 --> 40:58.980
I didn't mean to scare you.

40:59.048 --> 41:00.490
I just wanted to return the housefly.

41:01.471 --> 41:02.980
Who knew you'd be so timid.

41:05.770 --> 41:07.980
It's my fault. I'm sorry.

41:08.980 --> 41:10.340
I'll give you a ride back.

41:10.340 --> 41:11.570
You're limping.

41:11.570 --> 41:13.204
It'd be dark by the time you get home.

41:14.980 --> 41:17.210
Give me a chance to redeem myself, okay?

41:21.140 --> 41:25.220
(Jiangcheng No. 2 Secondary School)

41:32.271 --> 41:33.460
I'm good at cycling, right?

41:33.460 --> 41:34.540
Eyes on the road.

41:34.540 --> 41:35.820
You still don't believe me?

41:38.290 --> 41:39.340
I can even do this.

41:39.340 --> 41:40.970
Okay, I believe you.

41:47.860 --> 41:48.900
I'll pay for your shirt.

41:48.900 --> 41:49.900
No need.

41:49.900 --> 41:51.500
Just stay away from me.

42:12.460 --> 42:13.260
(No way.)

42:13.730 --> 42:15.420
(It's bad luck every time I see you.)

42:15.570 --> 42:16.290
(I quit.)

42:22.580 --> 42:23.920
(A Female Worker's Hymn of Love)

42:23.920 --> 42:25.120
(For 20 years, a female worker
has been nursing a wounded hero.)

42:25.120 --> 42:26.220
(Now married, her dedication
has also won her a place in university.)

42:29.420 --> 42:30.210
Fang Muyang.

42:31.540 --> 42:33.950
As long as I take good care of you,

42:34.290 --> 42:37.130
I might get picked as a role model.

42:37.250 --> 42:39.130
When I become a role model,

42:39.130 --> 42:40.540
they'd have no reason

42:40.540 --> 42:42.020
to deny my university referral.

42:48.130 --> 42:49.130
Fang Muyang.

42:49.820 --> 42:52.130
You got me into trouble so many times.

42:52.250 --> 42:53.060
This time,

42:53.460 --> 42:55.540
you have to make it up to me.

42:55.540 --> 42:57.500
Wake up soon,

42:57.500 --> 43:00.290
and I'll write everything off.

43:00.290 --> 43:01.730
We'll be even, okay?

43:06.090 --> 43:07.090
Silence is consent.

43:07.090 --> 43:08.570
That's settled, then.

43:09.900 --> 43:11.020
Let's work hard together.

43:11.460 --> 43:12.500
Old friend.

43:28.860 --> 43:33.340
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

43:35.900 --> 43:40.620
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

43:43.140 --> 43:49.260
♪In the little courtyard,
there you are dancing♪

43:50.260 --> 43:54.820
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

43:57.300 --> 44:02.060
♪In spring, I stay by your side♪

44:04.500 --> 44:08.860
♪When summer comes, I watch over you♪

44:11.220 --> 44:17.860
♪In the light of dawn, you belong to me♪

44:17.860 --> 44:27.460
♪At the edge of the world,
I will still hold you tight♪

44:28.540 --> 44:34.700
♪There is a small place♪

44:34.700 --> 44:41.500
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

44:41.500 --> 44:48.860
♪Every lovely face♪

44:49.740 --> 44:55.900
♪Shines brightly in the heart♪

44:56.700 --> 45:02.740
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

45:03.940 --> 45:09.740
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

45:10.820 --> 45:17.100
♪My you, walking toward the distance♪

45:17.900 --> 45:26.140
♪Please carry our dreams
and let them soar♪
